{"speciesId":799,"names":{"fr":"Engloutyran","es":"Guzzlord","en":"Guzzlord","ja":"アクジキング"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Une espèce d’Ultra-Chimère. On l’aurait aperçue dévorant des montagnes et des gratte-ciel."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se dice que este Ultraente ha sido avistado devorando montañas enteras y tragándose prominentes edificios."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It has gobbled mountains and swallowed whole buildings, according to reports. It’s one of the Ultra Beasts."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"山を 喰らい 削り ビルを 飲みこむ 姿が 報告 された。 ウルトラビーストの 一種。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"L’une des dangereuses Ultra-Chimères. Elle est constamment en train de manger, mais ne semble pas produire d’excréments."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Un Ultraente extremadamente peligroso. Engulle todo lo que encuentra, pero, por alguna razón, no se han encontrado excrementos suyos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"A dangerous Ultra Beast, it appears to be eating constantly, but for some reason its droppings have never been found."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"危険生物 ビーストの 一種。 つねに なにかを 喰らっているようだが なぜか フンは 未発見。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cette créature venue d’ailleurs est dangereuse dans notre monde, mais il semblerait qu’elle soit très commune dans le sien."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Para los seres de este mundo resulta extraño y peligroso, pero en el mundo del que procede es una criatura muy común."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it’s alien to this world and a danger here, it’s apparently a common organism in the world where it normally lives."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"この世界では 異質で 危険だが 本来 棲んでいる 世界では 普通に 見かける 生物らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cette créature inconnue appelée « Ultra-Chimère » semble constamment affamée : elle mange en permanence."},{"languag